# NOTE: everything under edge/ is COMMITTED -- the playbooks (edge/*.md), the analyst-queued
# screen variants (edge/*.proposed.json), AND the machine-readable verdicts sidecars
# (edge/*.verdicts.json). The sidecars were previously gitignored as "regenerated each run",
# but the ONLY writer is the reflection pass -- ignoring them meant no runtime (and no Docker
# image) could ever see a verdict, freezing the insight engine and the autonomy gate at zero
# (2026-07-01 audit). Reflection PRs commit them; the image ships them.
